{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Porch swing creaking [A]in the evening heat
[G]Lemonade sweating on the [A]window seat
[D]Fireflies blinking [A]out a code
[G]Spelling out the wa[A]y back down t[D]he road
{end_of_verse}

